">like </span><span begin="01:55.690" end="01:56.260">you </span><span begin="01:56.260" end="01:57.430">somebody</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.460" end="02:01.090"><span begin="01:57.460" end="01:58.960">Falling </span><span begin="01:58.960" end="01:59.650">just </span><span begin="01:59.650" end="01:59.890">as </span><span begin="01:59.890" end="02:01.090">hard</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.120" end="02:06.220"><span begin="02:01.120" end="02:01.450">I'd </span><span begin="02:01.450" end="02:01.930">rather </span><span begin="02:01.930" end="02:02.560">lose </span><span begin="02:02.560" end="02:03.700">somebody </span><span begin="02:03.700" end="02:04.030">than </span><span begin="02:04.030" end="02:04.720">use </span><span begin="02:04.720" end="02:06.220">somebody</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.280" end="02:14.680"><span begin="02:06.280" end="02:07.540">Maybe </span><span begin="02:07.540" end="02:08.080">it's </span><span begin="02:08.080" end="02:08.350">a </span><span begin="02:08.350" end="02:09.580">blessing </span><span begin="02:09.580" end="02:10.060">in </span><span begin="02:10.060" end="02:12.400">disguise </span><span begin="02:12.400" end="02:12.580">I </span><span begin="02:12.580" end="02:12.970">sold </span><span begin="02:12.970" end="02:13.030">my </span><span begin="02:13.030" end="02:13.330">soul </span><span begin="02:13.330" end="02:13.390">for </span><span begin="02:13.390" end="02:14.680">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.710" end="02:22.210"><span begin="02:14.710" end="02:15.220">I </span><span begin="02:15.220" end="02:15.790">see </span><span begin="02:15.790" end="02:16.360">my </span><span begin="02:16.360" end="02:18.040">reflection </span><span begin="02:18.040" end="02:18.490">in </span><span begin="02:18.490" end="02:18.850">your </span><span begin="02:18.850" end="02:20.800">eyes </span><span begin="02:20.800" end="02:21.100">tell </span><span begin="02:21.100" end="02:21.340">me 